00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.100
Malaysian?

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:25.130
No.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:31.130
Malison... is like a type of fog that has 
the power to make wishes come true.

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:34.640
It occurs naturally throughout the world,

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.640
<b>Malison</b>

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:38.020
having a subtle influence 
over all things that happen.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:44.110
We tsukumogami are generally the 
result of the accumulation of malison

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:46.150
over an extended period of time.

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:50.210
However, should an abnormally rich 
amount of malison come under

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:53.000
the influence of an intense desire or wish,

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.320
it can create an instant tsukumogami,

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:57.700
