00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:04.030
Right. An undercover operation.

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.260
Now then, people...

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:08.280
We need to requisition your panties.

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:11.030
Under no circumstances!

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.270
If mine will suffice, you can have them.

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:15.290
It obviously has to be a girl's!

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.290
That's sexual harassment!

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:19.540
Amasogi are like animals, true enough.

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:22.380
A bit of bait might be just what we need...

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:29.730
Sorry about this, Kiriha-san.

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:33.050
Put them on, take them off... 
You just can't seem to decide, can you?

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:36.560
Well, you always sit around 
the house without any on!

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:38.830
Uh, forget I said anything.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:42.310
Does this really have 
any chance of working?

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:45.320
It is a fairly primitive trap.

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:50.570
Did we catch something?

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:52.190
Careful, now.

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:52.980
Right.

00:14:57.930 --> 00:14:59.110
What the hell?

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:02.380
A frog... embroidered on a 
pair of underpants, it seems.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:03.860
Little girls' panties.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:07.480
I'm guessing the size is 120.

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:08.890
Hey, Chisato...

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:11.750
Isn't this pair...

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:13.970
No, it's not!

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:18.420
Ribbit!

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:20.730
It ran!

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:22.530
After it, Kazuya!

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:39.200
It's gathering malison?!

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:47.460
Ribbit!

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:50.010
Seems ready for a fight.

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:57.970
Kiriha-san!

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.100
Right!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:06.360
It's collecting malison 
from the surroundings.

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:08.500
Best to wrap this up quickly.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:09.220
Right!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:12.580
Ribbit!

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:13.860
Shield Weave!

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:16.140
Grab it!

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:17.700
Hand Weave!

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:19.130
Ribbit!

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:26.080
Sledgehammer Weave!

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:33.130
No effect!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:35.510
Squishy little beast, isn't it?!

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:36.970
Kazuya-kun!

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:39.690
What the hell is that?!

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.930
I would assume it's the berserk amasogi.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:44.700
But it's a pair of p-p-p-panties!

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:45.340
Indeed it is.

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:46.440
Hey, Chisato!

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:48.690
That pair belongs to you, doesn't it?!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:53.020
I know it does! 
I remember seeing them before!

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:54.450
Why do you remember that?!

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:57.650
Ribbit!

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.950
Whoa, it's even bigger!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.660
You need to admit it, Chisato!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:06.960
That's right! You were so desperate for 
underwear, it gave birth to an amasogi!

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:09.690
Damn, Chikaishi... Seriously?

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:12.470
This is exactly why I 
didn't want to admit it!

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:14.540
Not to mention, I have no such desire!

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:15.670
You don't?

00:17:15.670 --> 00:17:17.150
I thought that seemed odd.

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:21.470
Kazuya-kun!

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:35.990
All right, Kazuya! We can't let this 
thing continue to run rampant!

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:37.610
We need to silence it in one blow!

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:38.570
Ribbit!

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:47.380
Three-point... Spiral Weave!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:49.000
<b>Three-point Spiral Weave</b>

00:17:49.350 --> 00:17:52.260
Ribbit!

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:01.510
What do we do about this?

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:05.130
It's true that those are mine, but...

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:08.520
They're from when I was little, 
and they'd been put away for so long...

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:12.020
I have no idea how this happened.

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.780
What was it, then?

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:15.750
Kazuya.

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:17.290
Strip.

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:19.370
I said strip, boy!

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:19.980
Okay!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:30.040
I think it was lonely.

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:36.050
There's sorrow in unused, discarded items.

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:39.550
Let this be its small comfort.

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:26.350
Was this for the best?

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:31.780
Wouldn't you prefer to be with the 
one you longed for in the end?

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.570
I guess so.

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:41.510
Um...

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:45.110
My underpants...

00:19:58.330 --> 00:19:59.590
Ribbit...

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:03.620
Thanks for the meal.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:05.010
I am stuffed!

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:07.010
Would it kill you to 
clean up after yourself?!

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:09.770
<b>Student claims to be a witness</b>

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:12.140
<i>I believe it was due to an 
atmospheric plasma discharge.</i>

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:18.170
I wonder what that frog's deal actually was...

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:19.570
Aye...

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:22.410
If Chisato didn't give rise to the amasogi,

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:24.930
it must have occurred naturally.

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:27.750
But that's supposed to 
take a long time, right?

00:20:29.510 --> 00:20:31.620
If a decade or so was 
enough to animate them,

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.540
the world would be crawling 
with tsukumogami.

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:37.170
Dense malison or not, 
there'd have to be more to it...

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:40.170
Ya-kun, is this all your laundry?

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:41.170
Yeah.

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:44.180
<i>No underpants...</i>

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:47.590
<i>Did he lose them? 
Did they fall off? Or maybe...</i>

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:48.930
Men > Underaged

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:48.930
Super rare! Fresh!  *A beautiful boy's under                                           cludes pictures!)

