00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:48.930
Shipping: Seller pays

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:48.930
<b>Purchase</b>

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:51.630
How much was it?! 
How much did they go for?!

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:53.610
Do you think there'll 
be trouble again soon?

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:57.190
No need to worry.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:00.440
Is that not why we called upon your friends?

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:02.570
I guess you're right.

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:04.700
Now, then...

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:10.640
Sir, do you feel itchy anywhere else?

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:11.950
No, not really.

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:13.340
What about here?

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:15.610
Hey!

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:17.210
Or perhaps...

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.710
down here?

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.700
Perky as usual, I see!

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:24.470
No!

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.780
Looks like it went down already.

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:31.720
That's fine.

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:35.100
Do we have another lead?

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:36.620
Yes.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:41.110
For now, we'll do things Azami's way.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:32.970
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:22.880
Sunao-san, who challenged
me to a duel before,

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:25.000
asked me to come to her house alone.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:29.870
I wasn't sure what to expect, 
but what happened still surprised me!

